'''''Lampranthus bicolor''''', the '''bicoloured lampranthus''', is a species of flowering plant in the family [[Aizoaceae]], native to the southwestern [[Cape Provinces]] of South Africa.<ref name="POWO_362168-1" >{{cite POWO |id=362168-1 |title=''Lampranthus bicolor'' (L.) N.E.Br. |access-date=4 June 2023 }}</ref> A spreading succulent reaching {{cvt|30|cm}}, it prefers to grow in sandy areas.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://pza.sanbi.org/lampranthus-bicolor |title=''Lampranthus bicolor'' (L.) N.E.Br. |last1=Tyambetyu |first1=Olivia |date=February 2011 |website=pza.sanbi.org |publisher=SA National Biodiversity Institute |access-date=4 June 2023 }}</ref>

